00:33:03.281 --> 00:33:05.116
That's where the court of
public opinion is critical

00:33:05.116 --> 00:33:06.617 align:start size:84% position:16%
and that's where a lot
of people who think

00:33:06.617 --> 00:33:09.420 align:start size:97% position:3%
